Subject: [PATCH 07/25] feat(ui): local shadcn primitives for
 web-ui-registration (L2)

button, input, label, separator, skeleton + a password-input (Fuselage's
PasswordInput replacement, eye-toggle via lucide-react) and a FormCallout
(danger/warning/success/info banner, replacing Fuselage's Callout).

FormCallout's status colors fall back to Tailwind's stock red/amber/
emerald/blue: tokens.json has no sampled status colors (mockups show no
error/success state).
